---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Chris Bendel" description="About Chris Bendel and this site.">
	<section class="about">
		<h1>Chris Bendel</h1>

		<h2>About</h2>
		<p>
			I use photography as a means to learn more about creative processes, failure, and why we bother doing things that are seemingly pointless.
			Photography gets me out in situations and places that I typically wouldn't be in, while also challenging the creative side of my brain.
			I'm self-taught, so I've learned a lot through many mistakes and plenty of ruined sheets of film.
		</p>

		<h2>Why?</h2>
		<p>
			I made this with the intention of serving as an archive of my work over the years and a place to reflect on the process.
		</p>

		<h2>Philosophy & Process</h2>
		<p>
			Early on someone I looked up to told me to stick to one film and one developer, which shaped how I approach photography.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>I shoot across all formats, but mostly 4x5 (with a few lenses) and medium format (a rolleiflex)</li>
			<li>I decided to shoot only black and white film stocks early on to force myself to learn more about composition and contrast</li>
			<li>I have landed on HP5+ for my film and HC-110 for my developer</li>
			<li>I scan my photos as a means to proof and organize, with the end goal being to print my favorites in my darkroom</li>
		</ul>


		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<dl class="contact">
			<dt>Email</dt>
			<dd><a href="mailto:chrissbendel@gmail.com">chrissbendel@gmail.com</a></dd>
			<dt>Elsewhere</dt>
			<dd><a href="https://cbendel.me" rel="me">cbendel.me</a></dd>
		</dl>

		<p class="colophon">
			You can subscribe to an <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> if you're into that.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Prose wants a shorter line than the page measure. */
	.about {
		max-width: 34rem;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	dl.contact {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
		gap: 0.3rem 1.25rem;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	dl.contact dt {
		color: var(--ink-faint);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		padding-top: 0.15rem;
		font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "JetBrains Mono", Menlo, monospace;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	dl.contact dd {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.colophon {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
</style>
